hadiths[62]{hadithnumber,text}:
"894","Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein mareez ki ayadat ka, janazey ke peechey chalney ka, chheenkney waley ko yarhamukallah kehney ka, qasam khaney waley ki qasam poori karne ka, mazloom ki madad ka, bulane waley ki dawat qabool karne ka aur salaam pheelaney ka hukm diya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"895","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ka Musalman par paanch haq hain: Salaam ka jawab dena, mareez ki ayadat karna, janazon ke peechey chalna, dawat qabool karna aur chheenkney waley ko yarhamukallah kehna. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"896","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall qayamat ke din farmayega: Ae aadmi ke betey! Main beemar hua to tune meri ayadat nahi ki! Wo kaheyga: Ae Rab! Main Teri ayadat kaisey karta jabke Tu jahaanon ka Rab hai?! Allah farmayega: Kya tu nahi jaanta tha ke mera fulaan banda beemar hua tha to tune uski ayadat nahi ki? Kya tu nahi jaanta tha ke agar tu uski ayadat karta to Mujhey uske paas paata? Ae aadmi ke betey! Main ne tujh se khana maanga to tune Mujhey nahi khilaya! Wo kaheyga: Ae Rab! Main Tujhey kaisey khilata jabke Tu jahaanon ka Rab hai?! Allah farmayega: Kya tu nahi jaanta tha ke merey fulaan bandey ne tujh se khana maanga tha to tune usey nahi khilaya, kya tu nahi jaanta tha ke agar tu usey khilata to usey merey paas paata? Ae aadmi ke betey! Main ne tujh se pani maanga to tune Mujhey nahi pilaya! Wo kaheyga: Ae Rab! Main Tujhey kaisey pilata jabke Tu jahaanon ka Rab hai?! Allah farmayega: Merey fulaan bandey ne tujh se pani maanga tha to tune usey nahi pilaya! Kya tu nahi jaanta tha ke agar tu usey pilata to usey merey paas paata? Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"897","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mareez ki ayadat karo, bhookey ko khilayo aur qaidi ko chhudayo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"898","Saubaan (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Musalman jab apne Musalman bhai ki ayadat karta hai to wapas aaney tak Jannat ke phalon mein rehta hai. Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Jannat ke phal kya hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Uske phal. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"899","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo Musalman subah kisi Musalman ki ayadat karta hai to shaam tak sattar hazaar farishtey us par rehmat bhejtey hain, aur agar shaam mein ayadat karey to subah tak sattar hazaar farishtey us par rehmat bhejtey hain, aur uske liye Jannat mein aik baagh hoga. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"900","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik Yahoodi ladka Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat karta tha, phir wo beemar ho gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski ayadat ke liye uske paas aey aur uske sar ke paas baithey phir us se farmaya: Musalman hoja. To us ne apne walid ki taraf dekha jabke wo uske paas tha? To us ne kaha: Abul Qaasim ki itaat kar. To wo Musalman ho gaya, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley jabke Aap farma rahey they: Tamam tareefein Allah ke liye hain jis ne usey dozakh se nijaat di. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"901","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kisi insaan ko koi takleef hoti ya usey phoda ya zakhm hota to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni ungli se is tarah farmatey, aur rawi Sufyan bin Uyaina ne apni shahaadat ki ungli zameen par rakhi phir usey uthaya aur farmaya: Allah ke naam ke sath, hamari zameen ki matti, ham mein se baaz ke thook ke sath, hamarey beemar ko shifa di jaeygi, hamarey Rab ke izn se. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"902","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ghar walon mein se baaz ki ayadat kartey to daayein haath se unhey chhoo-tey aur farmatey: Ae Allah! Logon ke Rab! Takleef door farma aur shifa ata farma, Tu hi shaafi hai, Teri shifa ke siwa koi shifa nahi, aisi shifa jo beemari na chhorey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"903","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Saabit (Rehmatullah aleh) se kaha: Kya main tumhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke dam se dam na karun? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah! Logon ke Rab! Takleef door karne waley! Shifa ata farma Tu hi shaafi hai, Tere siwa koi shaafi nahi, aisi shifa jo beemari na chhorey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"904","Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne meri ayadat ki aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Saad ko shifa ata farma, ae Allah! Saad ko shifa ata farma, ae Allah! Saad ko shifa ata farma. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"905","Abu Abdullah Usman bin Abil Aas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apne jism mein paaney waley dard ki shikayat ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apna haath apne jism ki us jagah par rakho jo dukhti hai aur kaho: Allah ke naam se, teen martaba, aur saat martaba kaho: Main Allah ki izzat aur uski qudrat ki panah maangta hun us shar se jo main paata hun aur jis se main darta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"906","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs aisi mareez ki ayadat karey jiski maut ka waqt nahi aaya, phir uske paas saat martaba kahey: Main Allah Azeem se, Arshe Azeem ke Rab se sawal karta hun ke wo tumhey shifa ata farmaye, to Allah usey us marz se aafiyat dega. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai, aur Haakim ne kaha: Bukhari ki shart par sahih hadis hai."
"907","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik dehaati ke paas uski ayadat ke liye aey, aur Aap jab kisi ki ayadat ke liye aatey to farmatey: Koi harj nahi, Insha Allah pakeeza (beemari gunahon se paak karne wali hai). Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"908","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Jibraeel Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aey aur farmaya: Ae Muhammad! Kya Aap beemar hain? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ke naam se main Aap ko dam karta hun, har us chiz se jo Aap ko takleef deti hai, aur har jaan ya haasid aankh ke shar se, Allah Aap ko shifa dega, Allah ke naam se main Aap ko dam karta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"909","Abu Saeed Khudri aur Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un donon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par gawahi di ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kahey: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Allah sab se bara hai, to uska Rab uski tasdeeq karta hai aur farmata hai: Merey siwa koi mabood nahi aur main sab se bara hun. Aur jab wo kahey: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi shareek nahi, to Allah farmata hai: Merey siwa koi mabood nahi, main akela hun mera koi shareek nahi. Aur jab wo kahey: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, usi ke liye baadshahat hai aur usi ke liye hamd hai, to Allah farmata hai: Merey siwa koi mabood nahi, merey liye baadshahat hai aur merey liye hamd hai. Aur jab wo kahey: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur na koi taqat aur na koi quwwat magar Allah ki taufeeq se, to Allah farmata hai: Merey siwa koi mabood nahi aur na koi taqat aur na koi quwwat magar mujh se. Aur Aap farmatey they: Jo shakhs apne marz mein inhey kahey phir mar jaey to usey dozakh nahi khaeygi. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"910","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Ali bin Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas se nikley us marz mein jis mein Aap ki wafaat hui to logon ne kaha: Ae Abul Hasan! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne subah kaisey ki? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki hamd ke sath Aap ne aafiyat se subah ki. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"911","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko suna jabke Aap mujh se tek lagaye huey farmatey they: Ae Allah! Mujhey bakhsh dey aur mujh par rehem farma aur mujhey Rafeeqe Aala se mila. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"912","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko haalate marga mein dekha jabke Aap ke paas pani ka piyala tha aur Aap apna haath piyaley mein daal-tey phir apne chehrey ko pani se ponch-tey, phir farmatey: Ae Allah! Maut ki sakhtiyon aur jaan kani par meri madad farma. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"913","Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Juhaina ki aik aurat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aai jabke wo zina se haamila thi, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne hadd waley gunaah ka irtikaab kya hai to mujh par hadd qaim karein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uske sarparast ko bulaya aur farmaya: Iske sath ahsaan kar, phir jab ye jan dey to merey paas isey lekar aana. To us ne aisa kya, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uske baarey mein hukm diya to us par kapdey kassey gaey, phir uske baarey mein hukm diya to usey rujm kar diya gaya, phir Aap ne us par namaz padhi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"914","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas dakhil hua jabke Aap ko bukhaar tha, to main ne Aap ko chhua aur kaha: Beshak Aap ko bahut sakht bukhaar hai. To Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak mujhey aisa bukhaar hota hai jaisa tum mein se do aadmiyon ko hota hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"915","Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey paas us dard mein ayadat ke liye tashreef laey jo mujhey shadeed tha, to main ne kaha: Mujhey wo pahunch chuka hai jo tum dekhtey ho, aur main maal wala hun, aur meri beti ke siwa koi waaris nahi, aur hadis zikr ki. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"916","Qaasim bin Muhammad se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha: Haey mera sar! To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Balke haey mera sar! Aur hadis zikr ki. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"917","Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ka aakhri kalaam La ilaha illallah ho wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga. Ise Abu Dawud aur Haakim ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Sahih sanad hai."
"918","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne faut honay walon ko La ilaha illallah ki talqeen karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"919","Umm Salama (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abu Salama ke paas aey jabke unki aankh phat gai thi to Aap ne usey band kar diya, phir farmaya: Beshak jab rooh qabz ki jati hai to nazar uske peechey jaati hai. To unke ghar walon mein se kuchh log cheekhney lagey, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne oopar sirf bhalai ki dua karo kyonke farishtey tumharey qaul par aameen kehtey hain. Phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Abu Salama ko bakhsh dey aur hidayat paaney walon mein uska darja buland farma, aur peechey rehne walon mein uski aulaad mein uska jaanasheen bana, aur hamein aur usey bakhsh dey ae jahaanon ke Rab, aur uski qabr mein uske liye kushadgi farma aur us mein uske liye noor farma. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"920","Umm Salama (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mareez ya mayyit ke paas haazir ho to bhalai kaho, kyonke farishtey tumharey qaul par aameen kehtey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jab Abu Salama faut ho gaey to main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Abu Salama faut ho gaey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Mujhey aur usey bakhsh dey aur mujhey uske badley achchha badla ata farma. To main ne kaha, phir Allah ne mujhey us se behtar badla diya jo merey liye us se behtar tha: Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam). Ise Muslim ne is tarah riwayat kya hai: Jab tum mareez ke paas haazir ho ya mayyit ke, shak ke sath, Abu Dawud waghera ne sirf mayyit bila shak riwayat kya hai."
"921","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo banda museebat mein mubtala ho phir kahey: Beshak ham Allah ke liye hain aur beshak ham usi ki taraf laut-ney waley hain: Ae Allah! Mujhey meri museebat mein ajr ata farma aur merey liye us se behtar badla ata farma, to Allah Taala usey uski museebat mein ajr dega aur uske liye us se behtar badla dega. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jab Abu Salama faut ho gaey to main ne kaha jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey hukm diya tha, to Allah ne mujhey us se behtar badla diya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam). Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"922","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab bandey ka beta faut ho jata hai to Allah Taala apne farishton se farmata hai: Tum ne merey bandey ke betey ko qabz kar liya? To wo kehtey hain: Haan. To Allah farmata hai: Tum ne uske dil ke phal ko qabz kar liya? To wo kehtey hain: Haan. To Allah farmata hai: Merey bandey ne kya kaha? To wo kehtey hain: Us ne Teri hamd ki aur inna lillahi wa inna ilehi rajioon padha. To Allah Taala farmata hai: Merey bandey ke liye Jannat mein aik ghar banao aur uska naam Baitul Hamd rakho. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"923","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala farmata hai: Merey momin bandey ke liye merey paas koi badla nahi jab main duniya walon mein se uske pyaarey ko qabz kar lun phir wo us par sawaab ki ummeed rakhey siwaey Jannat ke. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"924","Usama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aik beti ne Aap ki taraf paighaam bheja ke Aap ko bulaya aur khabar di ke uska bachcha, ya beta, marga ke qareeb hai, to Aap ne qaasid se farmaya: Uske paas wapas jao aur usey khabar do ke Allah Taala ka hai jo us ne liya aur usi ka hai jo us ne diya, aur har chiz uske paas muqarrar waqte muayyan ke sath hai, isliye usey hukm do ke sabr karey aur sawaab ki ummeed rakhey. Aur poori hadis zikr ki. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"925","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Saad bin Ubada ki ayadat ki jabke Aap ke sath Abdur Rahman bin Auf aur Saad bin Abi Waqqas aur Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhum) they, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) roey, phir jab logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka rona dekha to wo roey, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum nahi suntey? Beshak Allah aankh ke aansu se azaab nahi deta aur na dil ke ghum se, lekin is se azaab deta hai ya rehem farmata hai, aur Aap ne apni zabaan ki taraf ishara kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"926","Usama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf Aap ki beti ka beta uthakar laaya gaya jabke wo marga ke qareeb tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki donon aankhein beh padhein, to Saad ne Aap se kaha: Ye kya hai ya Rasulullah?! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye rehem hai jo Allah Taala ne apne rehem karne waley bandon ke dilon mein rakha hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"927","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne betey Ibrahim (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aey jabke wo jaan kani mein tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki donon aankhein behney lagein. To Abdur Rahman bin Auf ne Aap se kaha: Aur Aap bhi ya Rasulullah?! To Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Ibn Auf! Beshak ye rehem hai. Phir uske baad doosri baat farmai: Beshak aankh aansu bahaati hai aur dil ghumgeen hota hai, aur ham sirf wahi kehtey hain jo hamarey Rab ko raazi karey, aur beshak ham terey firaaq se ae Ibrahim ghumgeen hain. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai, aur Muslim ne baaz hissa riwayat kya hai. Aur is baab mein Sahih mein bahut si mashhoor ahadis hain, Allah behtar jaanta hai."
"928","Abu Raafe Aslam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aazaad karda ghulaam se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs mayyit ko ghusl dey aur us par parda daaley to Allah usey chaalees martaba bakhsh dega. Ise Haakim ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Muslim ki shart par sahih hai."
"929","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs janazey mein haazir ho yahan tak ke us par namaz padhi jaey to uske liye aik qeeraat hai, aur jo us mein haazir ho yahan tak ke wo dafan ki jaey to uske liye do qeeraat hain. Kaha gaya: Do qeeraat kya hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do bahut badey pahadon ke barabar. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"930","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kisi Musalman ke janazey ke peechey imaan aur sawaab ki ummeed ke sath chaley, aur uske sath rahey yahan tak ke us par namaz padhi jaey aur uske dafan se farigh ho, to wo do qeeraat ajr ke sath wapas aata hai, har qeeraat Uhad ke barabar hai, aur jo us par namaz padhey phir dafan se pehley wapas aa jaey to wo aik qeeraat ke sath wapas aata hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"931","Umm Atiya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hamein janazon ke peechey chalney se mana kya gaya, lekin ham par sakhti nahi ki gai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur iske maana hain: Aur nahi tashdeed ki gai mana karne mein jaisa haraam kaamon mein tashdeed ki jati hai."
"932","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis mayyit par Musalmanon ki aik jamaat namaz padhey jo sau tak pahunchti ho aur sab uske liye sifarish karein to unki sifarish uske haq mein qabool ki jaeygi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"933","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo Musalman aadmi faut ho jaey phir uske janazey par chaalees aadmi khadey hon jo Allah ke sath kisi chiz ko shareek nahi thehratey to Allah unki sifarish uske haq mein qabool farmayega. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"934","Marsad bin Abdullah Yazani se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Maalik bin Hubaira (Raziallahu anhu) jab janazey par namaz padhtey aur log us par thorey hotey to unhey us par teen hisson mein taqseem kartey, phir farmatey: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis par teen safein namaz padhein to wo waajib ho gai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"935","Abu Abdur Rahman Auf bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne janazey par namaz padhi, to main ne Aap ki dua mein se yaad kya jabke Aap farmatey they: Ae Allah! Usey bakhsh dey aur us par rehem farma, aur usey aafiyat ata farma aur us se darguzar farma, aur uski manzil ko izzat ata farma aur uske dakhil honay ki jagah ko kushada farma, aur usey pani aur baraf aur oolon se dho, aur usey khataon se paak farma jaisa Tune safed kapdey ko mail se paak kya, aur usey uske ghar se behtar ghar ata farma, aur uske ghar walon se behtar ghar waley, aur uski biwi se behtar biwi, aur usey Jannat mein dakhil farma, aur usey qabr ke azaab se aur dozakh ke azaab se panah ata farma. Yahan tak ke main ne tamanna ki ke kaash wo mayyit main hota. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"936","Abu Hurairah aur Abu Qatada aur Abu Ibrahim Ash-hali se apne walid se, aur unke walid sahaabi hain (Raziallahu anhum), Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne janazey par namaz padhi aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Hamarey zinda aur murda ko bakhsh dey, aur hamarey chhotey aur badey ko, aur hamarey mard aur aurat ko, aur hamarey haazir aur ghaaib ko. Ae Allah! Ham mein se jisey Tu zinda rakhey to usey Islam par zinda rakh, aur ham mein se jisey Tu wafaat dey to usey imaan par wafaat dey. Ae Allah! Hamein uske ajr se mehroom na kar aur uske baad hamein fitney mein na daal. Ise Tirmizi ne Abu Hurairah aur Abu Qatada ki riwayat se naql kya hai, aur Ash-hali ki riwayat sahih hai, aur ise Abu Dawud ne Abu Hurairah aur Abu Qatada ki riwayat se naql kya hai. Haakim ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ki hadis Bukhari aur Muslim ki shart par sahih hai. Tirmizi ne kaha: Bukhari ne kaha: Is hadis ki sab se sahih riwayaat Ash-hali ki riwayat hai. Bukhari ne kaha: Aur is baab mein sab se sahih chiz Auf bin Maalik ki hadis hai."
"937","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab tum mayyit par namaz padho to uske liye khuloos se dua karo. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"938","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se janazey ki namaz mein riwayat hai: Ae Allah! Tu uska Rab hai, aur Tune usey paida kya, aur Tune usey Islam ki hidayat di, aur Tune uski rooh qabz ki, aur Tu uske posheeda aur zaahir ko zyada jaanne wala hai, ham Terey paas uske sifarshi bankar aey hain, isliye usey bakhsh dey. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"939","Waasila bin Al-Asqa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Musalmanon mein se aik aadmi ke janazey par namaz padhai, to main ne Aap ko farmatey huey suna: Ae Allah! Beshak fulaan bin fulaan Terey zimma aur Teri panah mein hai, isliye usey qabr ke fitney aur dozakh ke azaab se bacha, aur Tu wafa aur hamd wala hai. Ae Allah! Usey bakhsh dey aur us par rehem farma, beshak Tu hi bakhshney wala rehem wala hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"940","Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne apni aik beti ke janazey par chaar takbeerein kahein, phir chauthi ke baad do takbeeron ke darmiyaan waqfey ke barabar khadey rahey, uske liye maghfirat maangtey aur dua kartey, phir farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisa kartey they. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Chaar takbeerein kahein, phir aik ghadi thehrey yahan tak ke main ne gumaan kya ke wo paanchween kaheingey, phir daayein aur baayein salaam phera. Phir jab wapas huey to ham ne un se kaha: Ye kya hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main tumhey us se zyada nahi dun jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kartey dekha, ya farmaya: Isi tarah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya. Ise Haakim ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Sahih hadis hai."
"941","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Janazey ko jaldi le jao, phir agar wo naik hai to bhalai hai jis ki taraf tum usey aagey badhatey ho, aur agar uske siwa kuchh hai to shar hai jisey tum apni gardanon se utartey ho. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: To bhalai hai jis ki taraf tum usey aagey badhatey ho."
"942","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they: Jab janaza rakha jata hai aur mard usey apni gardanon par uthatey hain, to agar wo naik hai to kehta hai: Mujhey aagey badhao, aur agar wo naik nahi hai to apne ghar walon se kehta hai: Haey us par afsos! Tum usey kahan le jaatey ho? Uski awaz har chiz sunti hai siwaey insaan ke, aur agar insaan suney to behosh ho jaey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"943","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki jaan uske qarz ke sath latki hui hai yahan tak ke uski taraf se ada kar diya jaey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"944","Husain bin Wahwah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Talha bin Al-Bara (Raziallahu anhu) beemar huey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki ayadat ke liye tashreef laey aur farmaya: Beshak main Talha ko nahi dekhta magar us mein maut aa chuki hai, isliye mujhey uski khabar do aur usey jaldi dafan karo, kyonke kisi Musalman ki laash ko uske ghar walon ke darmiyaan rokna munaasib nahi. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"945","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Baqeeul Gharqad mein janazey mein they to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas tashreef laey aur baith gaey, aur ham Aap ke gird baith gaey jabke Aap ke paas chhoti laathi thi, to Aap ne sar jhukaya aur apni laathi se zameen kured-ney lagey, phir farmaya: Tum mein se koi bhi nahi magar uska thikana dozakh se aur uska thikana Jannat se likh diya gaya hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! To kya ham apni taqdeer par bharosa na kar lein? To Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Amal karo kyonke har aik ke liye wo aasaan kar diya gaya hai jis ke liye wo paida kya gaya hai. Aur poori hadis zikr ki. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"946","Abu Amr, aur kaha gaya Abu Abdullah, aur kaha gaya Abu Laila, Usman bin Affan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab mayyit ke dafan se farigh hotey to us par khadey hotey aur farmatey: Apne bhai ke liye maghfirat maango aur uske liye saabit qadmi ka sawal karo, kyonke wo ab sawal kya ja raha hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"947","Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab tum mujhey dafan karo to meri qabr ke gird itni dair thehro jitni mein oont zibah karne aur uska gosht taqseem karne mein lagti hai taake main tum se maanoos hun aur jaan lun ke main apne Rab ke bheje huey farishton ko kya jawab dun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai, aur ye apni taveel soorat mein guzar chuki hai. Aur Shaafai (Rehmatullah aleh) ne kaha: Aur mustahab hai ke uske paas Quran mein se kuchh padha jaey, aur agar uske paas Quran khatm karein to achchha hai."
"948","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Beshak meri walida achanak faut ho gaein aur mera khayaal hai ke agar wo boltein to sadqa kartein, to kya unke liye ajr hai agar main unki taraf se sadqa karun? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haan. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"949","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab insaan mar jata hai to uska amal munqata ho jata hai siwaey teen ke: sadqa jariya, ya aisa ilm jis se faeda uthaya jaey, ya naik beta jo uske liye dua karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"950","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Log aik janazey par guzrey aur uski tareef mein bhalai kahi, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Waajib ho gai. Phir doosrey par guzrey aur uski tareef mein burai kahi, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Waajib ho gai. To Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Kya waajib ho gai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Is ki tum ne bhalai mein tareef ki to uske liye Jannat waajib ho gai, aur is ki tum ne burai mein tareef ki to us par dozakh waajib ho gai, tum zameen mein Allah ke gawaah ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"951","Abul Aswad se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Madina aaya aur Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas baitha, phir unke paas se aik janaza guzra to uske saathi ki bhalai mein tareef ki gai to Umar ne kaha: Waajib ho gai. Phir doosra guzra to uske saathi ki bhalai mein tareef ki gai to Umar ne kaha: Waajib ho gai. Phir teesra guzra to uske saathi ki burai mein tareef ki gai to Umar ne kaha: Waajib ho gai. Abul Aswad ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Waajib kya ho gai ae Ameerul Momineen? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha jaisa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis Musalman ke liye chaar bhalai ki gawahi dein to Allah usey Jannat mein dakhil farmayega. To ham ne kaha: Aur teen? Aap ne farmaya: Aur teen. To ham ne kaha: Aur do? Aap ne farmaya: Aur do. Phir ham ne un se aik ke baarey mein sawal nahi kya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"952","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Musalman faut ho jaey aur uske liye teen bachchey hon jo bulooghat ko nahi pahunchy to Allah usey un par apni rehmat ke fazl se Jannat mein dakhil farmayega. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"953","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalmanon mein se jis ka teen bachchey mar jaein to usey dozakh nahi chhueygi magar qasam poori honay ke barabar. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"954","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mard Aap ki hadis lekar gaey hain, isliye hamarey liye apni taraf se aik din muqarrar karein jis mein ham Aap ke paas aaein aur Aap hamein us mein se sikhaein jo Allah ne Aap ko sikhaya hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fulaan fulaan din jama hojao. To wo jama ho gaein, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke paas aey aur unhey us mein se sikhaya jo Allah ne Aap ko sikhaya tha, phir farmaya: Tum mein se jo aurat teen bachchey aagey bhejey to wo uske liye dozakh se parda hongey. To aik aurat ne kaha: Aur do? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur do. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"955","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sahaaba se farmaya, yaani jab wo Hijr, Samood ke gharon tak pahunchy: In azaab diye gaey logon ke paas dakhil na ho siwaey iske ke tum rotey huey ho, phir agar tum rotey huey na ho to unke paas dakhil na ho, kahin tumhey wo (azaab) na pahunchy jo unhey pahuncha. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein farmaya: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hijr par guzrey to farmaya: Un logon ke maskanon mein dakhil na ho jinhon-ne apni jaanon par zulm kya ke tumhey wo (azaab) na pahunchy jo unhey pahuncha siwaey iske ke tum rotey huey ho. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna sar dhaanpa aur tez chaley yahan tak ke waadi se guzar gaey."
